      "chunk_id": "SC_2022_HEMANT_KUMAR_VERMA_VS_EMPLOYEES_STATE_INSURANCE_CORPORATI_P001_C01",
      "text": "created under the Employees’ State Insurance Act 1948 2. Act 18 of 2010 inserted",
      "paragraph_type": "unknown",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 2,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2022_HEMANT_KUMAR_VERMA_VS_EMPLOYEES_STATE_INSURANCE_CORPORATI_P002_C01",
      "text": "Section 59(B) in the Act of 1948 which stipulates that the Corporation may establish",
      "paragraph_type": "facts",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 3,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2022_HEMANT_KUMAR_VERMA_VS_EMPLOYEES_STATE_INSURANCE_CORPORATI_P003_C01",
      "text": "medical colleges, nursing colleges, and training institutions for its employees to",
      "paragraph_type": "facts",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 4,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2022_HEMANT_KUMAR_VERMA_VS_EMPLOYEES_STATE_INSURANCE_CORPORATI_P004_C01",
      "text": "Scheme. The petitioners are junior residents who have completed their undergraduate",
      "paragraph_type": "facts",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 5,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2022_HEMANT_KUMAR_VERMA_VS_EMPLOYEES_STATE_INSURANCE_CORPORATI_P005_C01",
      "text": "students pursuing their education in institutions conducted by the ESIC have to serve in",
      "paragraph_type": "facts",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 6,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2022_HEMANT_KUMAR_VERMA_VS_EMPLOYEES_STATE_INSURANCE_CORPORATI_P006_C01",
      "text": "the institutions as junior residents. The petitioners were required to serve a five year",
      "paragraph_type": "facts",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 7,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2022_HEMANT_KUMAR_VERMA_VS_EMPLOYEES_STATE_INSURANCE_CORPORATI_P007_C01",
      "text": "bond as junior residents.\n2 The respondent-institutions recruit Insurance Medical Officers Grade-II 3 through a",
      "paragraph_type": "facts",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 8,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2022_HEMANT_KUMAR_VERMA_VS_EMPLOYEES_STATE_INSURANCE_CORPORATI_P008_C01",
      "text": "written examination followed by an interview. ESIC provides a fifty per cent reservation",
      "paragraph_type": "facts",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 9,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2022_HEMANT_KUMAR_VERMA_VS_EMPLOYEES_STATE_INSURANCE_CORPORATI_P009_C01",
      "text": "for “in-service” doctors in the post-graduate seats available in medical institutions run by",
      "paragraph_type": "facts",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 10,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2022_HEMANT_KUMAR_VERMA_VS_EMPLOYEES_STATE_INSURANCE_CORPORATI_P010_C01",
      "text": "ESIC. While the post of IMO-II is included within the ambit of ‘in-service’ doctors, the",
      "paragraph_type": "facts",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 11,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2022_HEMANT_KUMAR_VERMA_VS_EMPLOYEES_STATE_INSURANCE_CORPORATI_P011_C01",
      "text": "junior doctors are not. The respondent issued a notice on 10 November 2021 inviting",
      "paragraph_type": "facts",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 12,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2022_HEMANT_KUMAR_VERMA_VS_EMPLOYEES_STATE_INSURANCE_CORPORATI_P012_C01",
      "text": "applications from eligible ‘in-service’ doctors of ESI Medical colleges. The petitioners",
      "paragraph_type": "facts",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 13,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2022_HEMANT_KUMAR_VERMA_VS_EMPLOYEES_STATE_INSURANCE_CORPORATI_P013_C01",
