      "chunk_id": "SC_2022_HEMANT_KUMAR_VERMA_VS_EMPLOYEES_STATE_INSURANCE_CORPORATI_P025_C01",
      "text": "July 2020, they have continued to serve of their own volition.\n(iv) The petitioners cannot be equated to IMO-II doctors to claim the 50%",
      "paragraph_type": "unknown",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
