      "chunk_id": "SC_2022_HEMANT_KUMAR_VERMA_VS_EMPLOYEES_STATE_INSURANCE_CORPORATI_P027_C01",
      "text": "and cannot be called in-service doctors; and\n(c) The medical officers are governed by the ESIC Staff and Condition",
      "paragraph_type": "unknown",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 28,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2022_HEMANT_KUMAR_VERMA_VS_EMPLOYEES_STATE_INSURANCE_CORPORATI_P028_C01",
      "text": "regulations.\n5 We have heard Mr Sachin Patil, counsel appearing on behalf of the petitioners",
      "paragraph_type": "arguments",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
