      "chunk_id": "SC_2022_HEMANT_KUMAR_VERMA_VS_EMPLOYEES_STATE_INSURANCE_CORPORATI_P031_C01",
      "text": "provision of reservation benefits. The qualification, entitlement, duties, responsibilities,",
