      "chunk_id": "SC_2022_HEMANT_KUMAR_VERMA_VS_EMPLOYEES_STATE_INSURANCE_CORPORATI_P036_C01",
      "text": "recognized reservation through institutional preference in post-Graduate medical",
      "paragraph_type": "unknown",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 37,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2022_HEMANT_KUMAR_VERMA_VS_EMPLOYEES_STATE_INSURANCE_CORPORATI_P037_C01",
      "text": "education in\nSaurabh Chaudri v. Union of India4\nand\nYatin Kuma Jasubahi v. State",
