      "paragraph_id": 41,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2022_HEMANT_KUMAR_VERMA_VS_EMPLOYEES_STATE_INSURANCE_CORPORATI_P041_C01",
      "text": "open to the petitioners to leave after the completion of one year of junior residency.",
