      "paragraph_id": 44,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2022_HEMANT_KUMAR_VERMA_VS_EMPLOYEES_STATE_INSURANCE_CORPORATI_P044_C01",
      "text": "such work as may be needed in the legitimate interest of patient care in ESI health",
      "paragraph_type": "unknown",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 45,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2022_HEMANT_KUMAR_VERMA_VS_EMPLOYEES_STATE_INSURANCE_CORPORATI_P045_C01",
      "text": "memorandum further states that the pay structure for the junior residents is similar to",
      "paragraph_type": "unknown",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 46,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2022_HEMANT_KUMAR_VERMA_VS_EMPLOYEES_STATE_INSURANCE_CORPORATI_P046_C01",
      "text": "the scale for the junior residents under the Central Residency Scheme. The IMO-II",
      "paragraph_type": "unknown",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 47,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2022_HEMANT_KUMAR_VERMA_VS_EMPLOYEES_STATE_INSURANCE_CORPORATI_P047_C01",
      "text": "doctors are governed by the ESIC Staff and Condition of Service Regulations 1959. The",
      "paragraph_type": "unknown",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 48,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2022_HEMANT_KUMAR_VERMA_VS_EMPLOYEES_STATE_INSURANCE_CORPORATI_P048_C01",
      "text": "crucial difference between junior residents and IMO- II is that while the former is a",
      "paragraph_type": "unknown",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 49,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2022_HEMANT_KUMAR_VERMA_VS_EMPLOYEES_STATE_INSURANCE_CORPORATI_P049_C01",
      "text": "contractual post where the doctors are employed directly due to the bond condition on",
      "paragraph_type": "unknown",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 50,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2022_HEMANT_KUMAR_VERMA_VS_EMPLOYEES_STATE_INSURANCE_CORPORATI_P050_C01",
      "text": "the completion of the MBBS degree, the latter is a permanent post. Therefore, the mode",
